{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "purpose": "simulation Phase 2 (#841): sm.openfromms scenarios run by CASA and by casa-rs, in two stages",
  "notes": [
    "Each scenario observes, closes and reopens its MS with openfromms; the calls after openfromms rewrite its rows. An openfromms_ms of casa has casa-rs reopen a copy of CASA's first stage (<name>.stage1.ms), so only the later calls' DATA differs; otherwise casa-rs reopens its own.",
    "Model images are named relative to the oracle's --model-root, as in sm_predict_scenarios.json: alma/model4 is 256 pixels of 0.05 arcsec centred on 10h -30d with one plane per channel of the 4-channel 230 GHz band.",
    "CASA's VisSet adds MODEL_DATA and CORRECTED_DATA to an MS without them; casa-rs creates neither (plan decision 6) and keeps the ones there are in step with DATA, which its laws check (crates/casa-simulation/tests/open_from_ms.rs). CORRECTED_DATA is not compared here.",
    "The moved-pointing scenarios observe a second pointing of 'target' moved 10.4 arcsec east, which keeps target's FIELD row: CASA phases it on the field, and so does casa-rs after openfromms. A point at the field predicts unit amplitude and zero phase in both pointings."
  ],
  "complists": {
    "point-at-field.cl": [
      {"flux": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"], "shape": "point", "freq": "230GHz"}
    ],
    "shapes.cl": [
      {"flux": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "10h00m00.1540", "-30d00m00.0"], "shape": "point", "freq": "230GHz"},
      {"flux": [0.5, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "09h59m59.7690", "-29d59m59.0"], "shape": "gaussian", "majoraxis": "1arcsec", "minoraxis": "0.5arcsec", "positionangle": "30deg", "freq": "230GHz", "spectrumtype": "spectral index", "index": -0.7},
      {"flux": [0.3, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0770", "-30d00m02.0"], "shape": "disk", "majoraxis": "2arcsec", "minoraxis": "1.5arcsec", "positionangle": "60deg", "freq": "230GHz"}
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "openfromms-predict-casa-ms",
      "data": "model",
      "openfromms_ms": "casa",
      "ignore": ["MAIN.CORRECTED_DATA"],
      "config": {"cfg": "alma.cycle10.3.cfg", "mount": "alt-az"},
      "calls": [
        {"op": "setspwindow", "spwname": "band6", "freq": "230GHz", "deltafreq": "15.625MHz", "freqresolution": "15.625MHz", "refcode": "TOPO", "nchannels": 4, "stokes": "XX YY"},
        {"op": "setfeed", "mode": "perfect X Y"},
        {"op": "setauto", "autocorrwt": 0.0},
        {"op": "settimes", "integrationtime": "30s", "usehourangle": true, "referencetime": ["UTC", "2026/03/21/00:00:00"]},
        {"op": "setfield", "sourcename": "target", "sourcedirection": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "observe", "sourcename": "target", "spwname": "band6", "starttime": "-300s", "stoptime": "300s"},
        {"op": "close"},
        {"op": "openfromms"},
        {"op": "predict", "imagename": "alma/model4.input.image"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "openfromms-predict-own-ms",
      "data": "model",
      "ignore": ["MAIN.CORRECTED_DATA"],
      "config": {"cfg": "alma.cycle10.3.cfg", "mount": "alt-az"},
      "calls": [
        {"op": "setspwindow", "spwname": "band6", "freq": "230GHz", "deltafreq": "15.625MHz", "freqresolution": "15.625MHz", "refcode": "TOPO", "nchannels": 4, "stokes": "XX YY"},
        {"op": "setfeed", "mode": "perfect X Y"},
        {"op": "setauto", "autocorrwt": 0.0},
        {"op": "settimes", "integrationtime": "30s", "usehourangle": true, "referencetime": ["UTC", "2026/03/21/00:00:00"]},
        {"op": "setfield", "sourcename": "target", "sourcedirection": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "observe", "sourcename": "target", "spwname": "band6", "starttime": "-300s", "stoptime": "300s"},
        {"op": "close"},
        {"op": "openfromms"},
        {"op": "predict", "imagename": "alma/model4.input.image"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "openfromms-vp-incremental-components-casa-ms",
      "data": "model",
      "openfromms_ms": "casa",
      "ignore": ["MAIN.CORRECTED_DATA"],
      "config": {"cfg": "alma.cycle10.3.cfg", "mount": "alt-az"},
      "calls": [
        {"op": "setspwindow", "spwname": "band6", "freq": "230GHz", "deltafreq": "15.625MHz", "freqresolution": "15.625MHz", "refcode": "TOPO", "nchannels": 4, "stokes": "XX YY"},
        {"op": "setfeed", "mode": "perfect X Y"},
        {"op": "setauto", "autocorrwt": 0.0},
        {"op": "settimes", "integrationtime": "30s", "usehourangle": true, "referencetime": ["UTC", "2026/03/21/00:00:00"]},
        {"op": "setfield", "sourcename": "target", "sourcedirection": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "observe", "sourcename": "target", "spwname": "band6", "starttime": "-300s", "stoptime": "300s"},
        {"op": "predict", "imagename": "alma/model4.input.image"},
        {"op": "close"},
        {"op": "openfromms"},
        {"op": "setvp", "dovp": true, "usedefaultvp": false},
        {"op": "predict", "complist": "shapes.cl", "incremental": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "openfromms-corrupt-casa-ms",
      "data": "noisy",
      "twin": "openfromms-predict-casa-ms",
      "noise_variance": 0.01,
      "openfromms_ms": "casa",
      "ignore": ["MAIN.CORRECTED_DATA"],
      "config": {"cfg": "alma.cycle10.3.cfg", "mount": "alt-az"},
      "calls": [
        {"op": "setspwindow", "spwname": "band6", "freq": "230GHz", "deltafreq": "15.625MHz", "freqresolution": "15.625MHz", "refcode": "TOPO", "nchannels": 4, "stokes": "XX YY"},
        {"op": "setfeed", "mode": "perfect X Y"},
        {"op": "setauto", "autocorrwt": 0.0},
        {"op": "settimes", "integrationtime": "30s", "usehourangle": true, "referencetime": ["UTC", "2026/03/21/00:00:00"]},
        {"op": "setfield", "sourcename": "target", "sourcedirection": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "observe", "sourcename": "target", "spwname": "band6", "starttime": "-300s", "stoptime": "300s"},
        {"op": "predict", "imagename": "alma/model4.input.image"},
        {"op": "close"},
        {"op": "openfromms"},
        {"op": "setseed", "seed": 4321},
        {"op": "setnoise", "mode": "simplenoise", "simplenoise": "0.1Jy"},
        {"op": "corrupt"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "openfromms-moved-pointing-casa-ms",
      "data": "model",
      "openfromms_ms": "casa",
      "ignore": ["MAIN.CORRECTED_DATA"],
      "config": {"cfg": "alma.cycle10.3.cfg", "mount": "alt-az"},
      "calls": [
        {"op": "setspwindow", "spwname": "band6", "freq": "230GHz", "deltafreq": "15.625MHz", "freqresolution": "15.625MHz", "refcode": "TOPO", "nchannels": 4, "stokes": "XX YY"},
        {"op": "setfeed", "mode": "perfect X Y"},
        {"op": "setauto", "autocorrwt": 0.0},
        {"op": "settimes", "integrationtime": "30s", "usehourangle": true, "referencetime": ["UTC", "2026/03/21/00:00:00"]},
        {"op": "setfield", "sourcename": "target", "sourcedirection": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "observemany", "sourcenames": ["target", "target"], "spwname": "band6", "starttimes": ["-120s", "0s"], "stoptimes": ["0s", "120s"], "directions": ["", "J2000 10h00m00.8 -30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "close"},
        {"op": "openfromms"},
        {"op": "predict", "complist": "point-at-field.cl"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "openfromms-moved-pointing-own-ms",
      "data": "model",
      "ignore": ["MAIN.CORRECTED_DATA"],
      "config": {"cfg": "alma.cycle10.3.cfg", "mount": "alt-az"},
      "calls": [
        {"op": "setspwindow", "spwname": "band6", "freq": "230GHz", "deltafreq": "15.625MHz", "freqresolution": "15.625MHz", "refcode": "TOPO", "nchannels": 4, "stokes": "XX YY"},
        {"op": "setfeed", "mode": "perfect X Y"},
        {"op": "setauto", "autocorrwt": 0.0},
        {"op": "settimes", "integrationtime": "30s", "usehourangle": true, "referencetime": ["UTC", "2026/03/21/00:00:00"]},
        {"op": "setfield", "sourcename": "target", "sourcedirection": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "observemany", "sourcenames": ["target", "target"], "spwname": "band6", "starttimes": ["-120s", "0s"], "stoptimes": ["0s", "120s"], "directions": ["", "J2000 10h00m00.8 -30d00m00.0"]},
        {"op": "close"},
        {"op": "openfromms"},
